' Sequence diagram for user authentication flow
@startuml
actor User
participant "Mobile App\n(React Native)" as MobileApp
participant "Authentication API\n(Cloud Functions/Cloud Run)" as AuthAPI
database "Cloud SQL\n(Users Table)" as UsersDB

User -> MobileApp: Initiates Sign-in (Google/Apple)
MobileApp -> AuthAPI: Sends Social ID Token
AuthAPI -> AuthAPI: Verifies Token (with Google/Apple)
AuthAPI -> UsersDB: Queries User by Social ID
alt User Found
  UsersDB --> AuthAPI: User Data
  AuthAPI -> MobileApp: Authentication Success
  MobileApp -> MobileApp: Navigates to Theme Selection
else User Not Found
  UsersDB --> AuthAPI: User Not Found
  AuthAPI -> MobileApp: Authentication Failed / Prompt for Registration (Optional)
end

@enduml